mmodule
Target Var(riscos_module) Init(0)
Build a 64-bit module (not a program): no GOT, no floating point or vector registers, the options of riscos64/kit/modflags.sh, the kit's runtime and C library.

mmodule-fp
Target Var(riscos_module_fp) Init(0)
As -mmodule, with the floating point and vector registers allowed in the module.
